# Conserved vocabulary module: fleet-adapter-matrix (fm:), absorbed 2026-09-30.
# Declarations from packs/fleet-adapter-matrix/ontology.ttl v0.1.0 (reformatted, same IRIs),
# plus the two family-level terms its families/*.ttl data used (fm:key, fm:deterministic)
# which its own ontology never declared. Drift note: fm:key held the template key string
# while fm:templateKey held a template PATH — the mapping disambiguates onto
# af:templateKey / af:templatePath respectively (same local name, different semantics).
@prefix fm: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/fleet-matrix#> .
@prefix af: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/adapter-family#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

fm:Projection a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass af:Projection .
fm:AdapterFamily a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass af:AdapterFamily .
fm:subject a owl:ObjectProperty ; owl:equivalentProperty af:subject .
fm:consumer a owl:ObjectProperty ; owl:equivalentProperty af:consumer .
fm:adapterFamily a owl:ObjectProperty ; owl:equivalentProperty af:family .
fm:targetRepo a owl:DatatypeProperty ; owl:equivalentProperty af:targetRepo .
fm:targetPath a owl:DatatypeProperty ; owl:equivalentProperty af:targetPath .
fm:key a owl:DatatypeProperty ; owl:equivalentProperty af:templateKey .
fm:templateKey a owl:DatatypeProperty ; owl:equivalentProperty af:templatePath .
fm:deterministic a owl:DatatypeProperty ; owl:equivalentProperty af:deterministic .
fm:authority a owl:DatatypeProperty ; owl:equivalentProperty af:authority .
